WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.790
How many agents does your company need?

2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.750
Starter comes with 5 agents and routines,

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.070
tasks that repeat on their own.

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.950
Elite, with 16 agents and more routines.

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.150
Magnata unlocks all 22,

6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.130
with 4 one-on-one mentoring sessions and human support on WhatsApp.

7
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.920
Every plan includes a live onboarding session

8
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.670
and support on WhatsApp and by email.

9
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.920
Outside the plan: the artificial intelligence subscription

10
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.860
and the tools you connect.

11
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.220
You pay by Pix or by card,

12
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.210
and every plan has a 30-day guarantee.

13
00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.530
The team is ready.

14
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.780
All that's left is choosing the size.
